# Week 6 – JavaScript Events, Fetch API & APIs

## Overview
This repository contains my Week 6 internship tasks, focusing on JavaScript event listeners, the Fetch API, asynchronous programming with async/await, and building a live API-powered webpage.

## Tasks Completed
- Task 1: Reviewed and improved Week 5 work
- Task 2: Created an interactive Event Listeners practice page
- Task 3: Built a Fetch API practice page that retrieves posts and random jokes
- Task 4: Developed a live Country Search application using the REST Countries API
- Task 5: Organized the repository and updated project documentation

